    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n86387" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πρῖσ-ις</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εως</span>, ἡ, (<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πρίω</span>) <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>sawing,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Arist.
				<u>PA</u>
				645b17
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Thphr.
				<u>HP</u>
				5.5.4
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Heliod.
			</span></i> ap. <i><span class="en">
				Orib.
				47.14.3
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b> in cranial
			surgery, <i>trephining,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Hp.
				<u>VC</u>
				9
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				21
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">π. ὀδόντων</span>
			<i>grinding</i> of the teeth, from anger, <i><span class="en">
				Plu.
				2.458d
			</span></i> (pl.); or as an effect of disease, <i><span class="en">
				Hp.
				<u>Prorrh.</u>
				1.48
			</span></i>.</div>
